 decrease the difficulty of fraud minigames.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193520/extras/9b65ec34b7ceeb2e20aef3c69be93af3.avif?t=1726531251\" width=620 height=348 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Missions and Mails</h2>Players will have various missions to complete, and some of them will lead to different endings. Players will also receive messages from victims they have successfully defrauded.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193520/extras/18cb380cb9e73ca60befaa8825f51d12.avif?t=1726531251\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193520/extras/c480d8a6739b6cc64c3d0d36881e7158.avif?t=1726531251\" width=620 height=348 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evening Entertainment</h2>Players can choose to have some entertainment with roommates in the evening, such as chatting, playing poker, and dice games. Entertainment is important as players need to relax after an entire day of work.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193520/extras/2ec4916f252cefa2582966997ce10889.avif?t=1726531251\" width=620 height=348 /></span>","developers":["Xi Zhang"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193520/header.jpg?t=1726531251","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b